{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_st01",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_st01",
  "title": "特別參觀通道",
  "storyCode": "CR-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "228b56d7f2d76308c25aad721268e198fdf0f966cb51d6010fe355a8c61fef7c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_labcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已進入磁山二號，重複一遍，我們已進入磁山二號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "DOC，你和FUZE那邊情況如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已確認外圍安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "考慮到磁山二號實驗室的特殊性，我建議從現在開始會合，一起行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "IANA，報告一下無人機偵察結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和我們上次撤離時幾乎沒有差別，儀表讀數相差無幾，設施內部也沒有發現其他人活動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我們上次離開之後，磁山二號的封鎖做得很徹底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，根本沒人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的任務是來尋找失蹤的ASH小隊，沒人算不上好消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意警戒，會合後我們直接往列維的主實驗室原址前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_caveentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，根據地圖，這裡就是列維的主實驗室應該在的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時我們只比寇恩他們晚了一步，先是感到一陣震動，然後……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道是列維那個瘋子幹的還是儀器本身出了問題，總之，整個主實驗室憑空消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確定是“憑空消失”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結合當時的情況和專家的意見，這是最合理的解釋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這太不現實了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有哪種現實中的爆炸能完全抹去一座實驗室的所有痕跡，留下巨大的空洞，外面的人卻只覺得震了兩下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地震？還是你們說的……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是地震！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "震動極有可能與失蹤事件有關！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位，原地尋找掩體，等待震動平息！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g7_galleriesstaircase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的軍人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1272_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長，請問藝術館到底有多少層？我腳都要走斷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……反正往上爬，爬到頂樓就對了，雷內爾就在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的軍人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1272_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們就不能搭電梯嗎？為什麼要在這裡一圈一圈地爬樓梯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為我不想嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出發前我們摸清了這裡的安保布置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那傢伙狡猾得很，建築內只有這部樓梯和一部他自己用的電梯可以通到頂樓，每層電梯口都有人把守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "樓梯是防守最為薄弱的一環，我們只能從這裡突破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的軍人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1272_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不就是個來這裡撈錢的卡西米爾人嗎？身後連個撐腰的人都沒有，不過是強迫他簽份轉讓協議，我們何苦做得這麼謹慎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，這個地方有錢撐腰還不夠嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "樓下那個，快點走兩步，別東張西望的了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懈怠的軍人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長，真的走不動了……我寧願坐電梯去跟他的安保人員拼刀拼弩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懈怠的軍人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）我們馬上就到那傢伙辦公室了！腳步放輕……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信？米沃什，我記得前幾天跟你說過了，寄給我的信你直接看就好，不必來問我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可這上面寫的是“望您親啟”哦，雷內爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信是從哪寄來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一封是從卡西米爾……好像是你叔叔的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，知道了，是來要遺產的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一封……來自多索雷斯市政府。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同一個城區寄信件給我？看來裡面講的事也不怎麼重要，八成又是無聊的宴會邀請函。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說不定坎黛拉也會去，我們可以跟她聊聊開幕式的事情。藝術館已經竣工，開幕式就在不久後，你在上面花費了許多心血……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望它能足夠震撼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過來，米沃什，和我站在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人走上前去，站到和紅髮沃爾珀肩並肩的位置上。\n兩人一同端詳起房間深處大概兩人高的藝術作品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米沃什，你覺得我將這件作品命名為“秩序的崩塌”怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……挺好的，你打算放在開幕式？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們一向有話直說，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那個扭曲的弧線代表的是“崩塌”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，那代表了整個社會對人的一瞥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一種帶著強烈規訓意味的、將一切不合規者審判為瘋狂的凝視，一種只有在大靜謐發生之後的伊比利亞才能誕生的畫作裡的線條。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……伊比利亞審判庭，確實，秩序的象徵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那右邊……形狀難以形容的角錐，代表的難道是萊塔尼亞的尖塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你想想薩爾貢千年的風沙，王酋、帕夏、黃金之城……對異域的想像同樣是一種內在秩序的建構。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是一種行將就木的想像力，起先還保持著一定的寬度，可最後除了陳腔濫調之外一無所有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦……沒錯，很有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實……剛剛那些話都是我唬爛的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……畢竟你的藝術總是那麼特立獨行，從材質到表達都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這玩意你是用多少高爾夫球搭的？一千顆？兩千顆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不重要，我們需要關注的只有最後一顆。怎麼樣，要不要幫我放上去，完成這件作品？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，放上去會發生什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這件作品會完成，也會在完成的那一刻——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人還沒來得及把話講完，便看到辦公室門縫下走動的陰影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不等他反應，那道門便被人踹開，連帶著整個房間都輕微晃動，令他面前本就岌岌可危的雕塑坍塌了一半，高爾夫球散落一地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……崩塌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷內爾，還有那個小秘書，抱頭蹲下，別想亂動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是什麼人不重要，你和你老闆得跟我們走一趟，否則別怪我們不客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "似乎有什麼東西在快速接近天花板。\n管他呢，大概是什麼巨大的羽獸吧，帶領的軍官想著，舉起手裡的弩，隔著半座高爾夫球雕塑對準了雷內爾——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然後，他聽見，就在“碩果僅存”的雕塑正上方，天花板上傳來一聲巨響。"
