    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已淨空，無人員死亡，算是個好消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們固然沒有刻意瞄準要害，但這些人皮糙肉厚得也的確有些超乎想像。連剛剛那個近距離吃了一發霰彈的傢伙也僥倖沒有生命危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實是好消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有另一個消息，不知道是好是壞，但很奇怪。這些人頭上的獸耳……仔細看可以看到血管……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可不知道列維還在研究這種事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ELA，我的指南針失效，DOC，你身上的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我們真的還在烏拉爾山南部的磁山二號附近……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "DOC轉頭看向身後，風剛好把窗簾吹了起來。\n幾人走上陽台，得以眺望先前一直無暇顧及的窗外景象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "夕陽從林立的高樓中間緩緩下落，把不知是海還是大湖的水域染得一片橘紅。\n水邊的沙灘上，冰淇淋車播放著音樂，幾個穿著清涼的遊客稀稀拉拉地躺在水邊，享受著假日傍晚的慵懶氣息。\n在幾人身後，房間裡唯一一個還能正常走路的人踱了過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是個*粗口*的烏拉爾山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少可以確定，我們確實不在任務原定區域了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……傳送？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們被傳送到了哪裡？馬爾地夫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡確實像個專門供人旅遊度假的地方，但……不像。我不覺得這裡是馬爾地夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許我們能問問那兩位不幸的受害者——哦，已經來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g11_deluxeroom_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，請問一下，您是哪位，這是哪裡，那些武裝人員又是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾位為我的作品製造了一個出人意料的結局，出於“感激”，我很高興能替各位介紹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，正式開始介紹前，請允許我糾正各位的一個錯誤……我從來都不是什麼不幸的受害者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去不是，現在不是，未來不是——從來都不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們可以進入正題了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，各位，歡迎踏上玻利瓦爾的黑色心臟……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎來到多索雷斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是雷內爾·科瓦爾斯基。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，雷內爾先生，你可以叫我ELA。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，考慮到我們需要快速把握現在的情況，我希望能省去介紹環節，我來問問題，你來回答，可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題，看來我也沒什麼選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷內爾先生，請問多索雷斯屬於哪個國家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "名義上屬於玻利瓦爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玻利瓦爾……玻利維亞？我不記得玻利維亞有座叫多索雷斯的城市。IANA，你有印象嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我換個問法。我們身處哪個大洲？南美洲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“大洲”？我不明白你的意思。如果你的意思是“大片的陸地”，那不就是泰拉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gówno……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（卡西米爾語）家鄉話？還真是意外呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家鄉話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼，你可以繼續提問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……難以相信我居然真的想問這個問題……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷內爾先生，我們身處的是否還是那顆被稱為地球的行星？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“地球”，“行星”……說實話，ELA小姐，我本來只等著解答你的問題。但聽了你的問題之後，我的問題也多起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "IANA，也許你會有一些更好的問法……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "IANA？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "IANA沒有回話。\n她瞪大雙眼，直勾勾地看向與夕陽落下方向相反的天際線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眾人隨著IANA目視的方向看去。\n一明一暗，兩輪月亮正在緩緩升起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g3_galleriessquare_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打扮誇張的杜林人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是運氣差，才畫了一個輪廓就被發現了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打扮誇張的杜林人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差點就被抓到了……烏泱泱追出來一大群人，嚇死了嚇死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藝術館保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給我站住，你這丫頭，在藝術館牆上亂塗亂畫還想跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打扮誇張的杜林人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好，他找過來了，我得趕緊走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打扮誇張的杜林人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，就算你今天運氣好……雷內爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
